  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This home is professionally managed by Beach Habitats 30A and comes with 6 bikes and 4 seater golf cart.<br><br>Welcome to Azalea Abbey!<br><br>- 350 Feet to the Beach Access<br>- Tower with Gulf Views<br>- Huge Outdoor Living Area<br><br><br>Nestled among the trees on a quaint Seagrove Road, this home is less than a block to 30A and a short walk to Seaside. This home has every amenity your family can imagine and is sure to be a favorite among all of your guests! From the open and spacious rooms, the hardwood floors, and the beautiful, beamed ceilings that greet you upon entering, Azalea Abbey will make you feel right at home.<br><br>The large kitchen and indoor and outdoor dining spaces give you multiple options for gathering. Families will also enjoy the bonus 3rd-floor area for relaxing. There's even a view of the Gulf from the top deck!<br><br>Enjoy a short stroll to The Surfing Deer, Seagrove Village Market, Cowgirl Kitchen, and more when you book this home for your next Beach Getaway. When you are in Seagrove Beach, you are arguably \"in the middle of it all\". Seaside, WaterColor, and Grayton are just a mile or two to the west, while the planned communities of WaterSound, Alys Beach, and Rosemary Beach are a few miles east. Not that you need to go anywhere, of course, as Seagrove is home to a wonderfully diverse assortment of restaurants, shops, and other local businesses, all of which are just a short stroll or bike-ride away.<br><br>Most homes in Seagrove are either tucked away beneath stately oak trees or overlooking the Gulf of Mexico.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS<br><br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>Bedroom 5: Queen Bed with Private Bathroom (Shower)<br>Living Room<br>Kitchen<br>Dining Room<br>Half Bathroom<br>Laundry Room (2 sets of washer and dryer)<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>Primary bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower and Soaking Tub (sleeps 2)<br>Bedroom 2: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower (sleeps 2)<br>Bedroom 3: Queen Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo (sleeps 2)<br>Bunk In the Hall: 2 Twin Beds (sleeps 2)<br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>Guest Bedroom: 4 Full Beds (sleeps 8)<br>Bathroom<br>Living Room<br>Kitchenette<br><br>FOURTH FLOOR:<br>Crows Nest with 180-degree Gulf Views<br><br><br>- Pool heat is available for an additional fee<br>- This home features a bunk bed in the hallway for additional sleeping options.<br>- Please note that the elevator is not available for guest use.<br><br>Parking Details:<br>- A maximum of 3 vehicles can park onsite.<br>- On-street parking is prohibited.<br>---<br><br>The room configuration is as follows:<br><br>Primary Bedroom / King bed w/ ensuite<br>Bedroom 2 / Queen bed w/ ensuite<br>Bedroom 3 / Queen bed w/ ensuite<br>Bedroom 4 / King bed w/ ensuite<br>Bedroom 5 / 4x full beds<br>Bunk bed in the hallway",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Welcome to Azalea Abbey! Private Pool, Golf Cart, Walk to Beach, Seaside"
        }
      ],
